/github.com/cubixmeow-commits/seeds-of-the-throne/blob/main/07%20QA/Questions.md\">Questions</a>, and <a href=\"https://github.com/cubixmeow-commits/seeds-of-the-throne/blob/main/07%20Coordination/Weekly%20Synthesis/CURRENT-WEEK-INTAKE.md\">CURRENT-WEEK-INTAKE</a>. Update <a href=\"https://github.com/cubixmeow-commits/seeds-of-the-throne/blob/main/07%20Coordination/CURRENT-PICKUP.md\">CURRENT-PICKUP</a> and the current task only if the author accepts a workflow-relevant decision.</li>\n</ul>"
